PASS counter uncommitted before frame
PASS counter commits the pass sum
PASS gauge records the set value
PASS scope records one sample
PASS fold covers every sample
PASS fold orders low <= mean <= high
PASS fold p99 within the window
PASS names answers every series
series:
  test.count
  test.fold
  test.gauge
  test.scope
PASS reset sweeps the registry
probes:
  frame.period
  gfx.draws
  input.age
PASS memory samples the rss gauge
PASS memory tracks the peak >= rss
memory:
  memory.peak
  memory.rss
PASS hardware disarms to unarmed
